            "notes": "Get these three blue items, sell your greens to do so if needed.\n\nIf you're rich enough, get one of the listed optional blue items as well.\n\n [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f) makes your ultimate even more valuable. Enemies are not expecting to move at half speed. It interrupts their plays, makes them confused/panic, and makes them easier for your team to hit. Do not sit on this ult. Use it to win team fights. Once you have it charged, use it in your next team fight. Don't hoard it, it will be charged again.",
