            "notes": "I've rarely played a Quickplay match that has made it to round 5 (in a good way), so I don't really know what's feasible to buy at this point. \n\nBuy these purples in the following order of priority, selling your blue items to make space/money to do so:\n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) ; more cooldown reduction\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) ; increases ult charge rate, if you haven't taken the item yet\n- [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) ; cooldown reduction and improved weapon power beyond what stats reflect (good in general but especially if you've taken [Triple Threat](item_fc0e3d9a-5315-41c2-9aa4-331becace714) or [Keen Kunai](item_d5993121-8a5f-4c59-9145-19dc55265f48) )\n\n\nRead the notes on each power option for situational tips on which to choose.",
